ive.google.com/drive/folders/10McwEOr7Wl2oSgn1s_vDrHWHZElNXvSn?usp=drive_link ご検討いただきありがとうございます！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@7shiomaneki53/works/44", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0ff49ae/uploads/origins/5f5ca6c1-5d4f-4acc-9214-4b97131e6217?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff1de766fc8208b3aacd3324822b9b45", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d0ff49ae/uploads/origins/5f5ca6c1-5d4f-4acc-9214-4b97131e6217?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff1de766fc8208b3aacd3324822b9b45, https://si.imgix.net/d0ff49ae/uploads/origins/5f5ca6c1-5d4f-4acc-9214-4b97131e6217?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f2556e66351bf721476feddf7e60ca10 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d0ff49ae/uploads/origins/5f5ca6c1-5d4f-4acc-9214-4b97131e6217?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=83ebdc2817f5c2de105c54dc6d4e92d1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I'd like to request a monster bug form for my vtuber model! I leave creative freedom to you and feel free to make any outfit, but I do request that he stays an Isopod. Also, If i like the design a lot I may ask if I can use it for another vtuber model when the times comes.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@7shiomaneki53/works/43", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d64e5a7/uploads/origins/96589058-7597-491d-ba45-f25ca31dc0e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f747ad2ff8bd35ad14080993eec0c53", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6d64e5a7/uploads/origins/96589058-7597-491d-ba45-f25ca31dc0e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f747ad2ff8bd35ad14080993eec0c53, https://si.imgix.net/6d64e5a7/uploads/origins/96589058-7597-491d-ba45-f25ca31dc0e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=767855c3eb678c855ec1dbf6b